"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <string $gs1>さんへの、<br>新しいレターは届いてないクポ。
#. de: Noch keine neuen Briefe für dich, kupo!
#. fr: Je suis désolé, mais je n'ai pas de courrier pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_1:1"
msgid "No new letters for you today, kupo!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 後輩君への、<br>新しいレターは届いてないクポ。
#. de: Na, wenn das nicht unser aller Lieblingspostbot<if $gn4>in<else>e</if> ist! Noch keine neuen Briefe für dich, kupo!
#. fr: Salut, apprenti<if $gn4>e</if> posti<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Je n'ai malheureusement pas de courrier pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>Hyur<case>Elezen<case>Lalafell<case>Miqo'te<case>Roegadyn<case>Au Ra<case>Hrothgar<case>Viera</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_001:1"
msgid "Well, if it isn't our favorite delivery <switch $gn71><case>Hyur<case>Elezen<case>Lalafell<case>Miqo'te<case>Roegadyn<case>Au Ra<case>Hrothgar<case>Viera</switch>! No new letters for you today, kupo!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 半人前君への、<br>新しいレターは届いてないクポ。
#. de: Nun sieh sich einer dieses Lächeln an! Dir kann man aber auch nichts ausschlagen. Aber ich muss dich leider enttäuschen - ich habe keine neuen Briefe für dich, kupo.
#. fr: Ah, <if $gn4>ma<else>mon</if> ch<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> assistant<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Ça me fait plaisir de te voir, même si je n'ai pas de courrier pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>sunshine<case>starlight<case>puppy fat<case>milk and honey<case>iron and ice<case>fire and blood<case>steel<case>moonbeams</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_100_001:1"
msgid "There's a smile made of <switch $gn71><case>sunshine<case>starlight<case>puppy fat<case>milk and honey<case>iron and ice<case>fire and blood<case>steel<case>moonbeams</switch>! I can deny you nothing─except new letters. There are none, kupo."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>君への、<br>新しいレターは届いてないクポ。<br>まあ、そんな日もあるクポ！
#. de: Ich würde ja nichts lieber tun, als einen Brief an meinen Schützling zuzustellen, aber leider habe ich heute keine Post für dich, kupo.
#. fr: Salut, collègue. Je n'ai malheureusement pas de courrier pour toi, kupo. J'espère que tu n'es pas trop déçu<if $gn4>e</if>...
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_101_001:1"
msgid "While I'd love nothing more than to deliver a letter to my proud protégé, I fear there is nothing for you today, kupo."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <string $gs1>さんへの、<br>新しいレターは届いてないクポ。<br>フェオ＝ウルからレターを預かったら教えるクポ！
#. de: Entschuldige, aber leider habe ich keine neue Post für dich, kupo. Feo Ul hat mir nichts für dich gegeben. Komm doch später noch mal wieder, kupo.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Désolé, mais Feo Ul ne m'a pas remis de courrier pour toi. Repasse plus tard, kupo<nbsp>!
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_102_001:1"
msgid "Why, hello! <string $gs1>, was it? I'm afraid I don't have any letters for you today. If I <i>did</i>, of course, I'd deliver them to you with speed and gusto!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <string $gs1>さん、<br>新しいレターを<num $n1>通預かっているクポ～♪
#. de: Sieh mal, <if ($n1 == 1)>ein neuer Brief ist<else><num $n1> neue Briefe sind</if> angekommen! Extra für dich, kupo!
#. fr: Bonne nouvelle, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! J'ai <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> lettre<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>sev… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><els… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_2:1"
msgid "Look what we have here! <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if></capitalize> new letters have arrived</if> just for you, kupo!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: やあやあ後輩君、<br>新しいレターを<num $n1>通預かっているクポ～♪
#. de: Sieh mal, <if ($n1 == 1)>ein neuer Brief ist<else><num $n1> neue Briefe sind</if> angekommen! Extra für <if $gn4>unsere Lieblingsassistentin<else>unseren Lieblingsassistenten</if>, kupo!
#. fr: Salut, apprenti<if $gn4>e</if> posti<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! J'ai <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> nouvelle<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> lettre<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>sev… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><els… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_002:1"
msgid "Look what we have here! <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if></capitalize> new letters have arrived</if> for our favorite assistant."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 半人前君への、<br>新しいレターを<num $n1>通預かっているクポ～♪
#. de: <if ($n1 == 1)>Ein neuer Brief ist<else><num $n1> neue Briefe sind</if> angekommen! Genau das Richtige für <if $gn4>unsere Postbotenveteranin<else>unseren Postbotenveteranen</if>, kupo!
#. fr: Ah, <if $gn4>ma<else>mon</if> ch<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> assistant<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>! Tu vas être content<if $gn4>e</if>, j'ai <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> nouvelle<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> lettre<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>sev… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><els… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_100_002:1"
msgid "Our loyal assistant is rewarded for <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> persistence! <if ($n1 == 1)>A new letter has arrived<else><capitalize><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if></capitalize> new letters have arrived</if> for you, kupo."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>君宛ての、<br>新しいレターを<num $n1>通預かっているクポ～♪<br>早速、確認してみてクポ！
#. de: Kupo! Ich freue mich, dir mitteilen zu können, dass ich <if ($n1 == 1)>einen neuen Brief<else><num $n1> neue Briefe</if> für dich habe, mein überaus begabter Lehrling!
#. fr: Salut, collègue<nbsp>! J'ai <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> lettre<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> pour toi<nbsp>! Je parie que tu as hâte de <if ($n1 == 1)>la<else>les</if> lire, kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>a new letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_101_002:1"
msgid "Kupo-ho-ho! I'm pleased to say that I have <if ($n1 == 1)>a new letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if> new letters</if> for you, my most proficient pupil!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <string $gs1>さん、<br>フェオ＝ウルからレターを預かったクポ～♪<br>全部で<num $n1>通あるクポ♪
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Ich freue mich, dir mitteilen zu können, dass Feo Ul mir <if ($n1 == 1)>einen neuen Brief<else><num $n1> neue Briefe</if> für dich gegeben hat, kupo.
#. fr: Réjouis-toi, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Feo Ul est passée me voir et m'a remis du courrier pour toi, kupo<nbsp>!♪
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>a new letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_102_002:1"
msgid "Let me see now... Why, yes! I do have <if ($n1 == 1)>a new letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if> new letters</if> addressed to <string $gs1>. Isn't today your lucky day, kupo?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、そろそろレターを整理しないと、<br>新しいレターが受け取れなくなるクポ。
#. de: Dein Briefkasten ist ja schon kupo voll, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Da solltest du was unternehmen, sonst platzt er bald aus allen Nähten.
#. fr: Au fait, je te signale que ta boîte est presque pleine, kupo<nbsp>! Si tu ne tries pas ton courrier, je ne pourrai bientôt plus prendre de lettres pour toi.
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_3:1"
msgid "Your mailbox is filling up fast! You should do something about it quick, or I won't be able to fit in any more letters, kupo!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、そろそろレターを整理しないと、<br>新しいレターが受け取れなくなるクポ。<br>レター整理は配達士のたしなみクポ。
#. de: Dein Briefkasten ist ja schon kupo voll, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Da solltest du was unternehmen, sonst platzt er bald aus allen Nähten. Von <if $gn4>unserer Lieblingsassistentin<else>unserem Lieblingsassistenten</if> hätte ich ein bisschen mehr Ordnung erwartet, kupo!
#. fr: Au fait, je ne sais pas si tu as remarqué, mais ta boîte est presque pleine. Si tu ne fais pas un peu de tri, je ne pourrai plus prendre de lettres pour toi. Savoir ordonner le courrier fait partie des devoirs du postier, kupo<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_003:1"
msgid "Your mailbox is filling up fast! You should do something about it quick, or I won't be able to fit in any more letters! I would have expected our favorite assistant to be more organized, kupo!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、そろそろレターを整理しないと、<br>新しいレターが受け取れなくなるクポ。<br>こういう気遣いが、配達士の成長につながるクポ。
#. de: Dein Briefkasten ist ja schon kupo voll, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Da solltest du was unternehmen, sonst platzt er bald aus allen Nähten. Für <if $gn4>eine Postbotenveteranin<else>einen Postbotenveteranen</if> wie dich ist das doch kein Problem, kupo!
#. fr: Au fait, je ne sais pas si tu as remarqué, mais ta boîte est presque pleine. Si tu ne fais pas un peu de tri, je ne pourrai plus prendre de lettres pour toi. En tant qu'assistant<if $gn4>e</if>, tu devrais savoir ça, kupo...
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_100_003:1"
msgid "Your mailbox is filling up fast! I won't be able to fit in any more letters unless you do something, kupo! And then where will you be?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、そろそろレターを整理しないと、<br>新しいレターが受け取れなくなるクポ。<br>送り主さんに申し訳ないから、整理をよろしくクポ。
#. de: <if $gn4>Eine erfahrene Postbotin<else>Ein erfahrener Postbote</if> hinterlässt ein solches Chaos in <if $gn4>ihrem<else>seinem</if> Briefkasten? Das kann nicht so bleiben, kupo! Räum mal ordentlich auf, sonst ist kein Platz für neue Briefe da!
#. fr: Au fait, je ne sais pas si tu as remarqué, mais ta boîte est presque pleine. Si tu ne fais pas un peu de tri, je ne pourrai plus prendre de courrier pour toi. Pense aux gens qui t'ont écrit et qui attendent avec impatience que tu lises leur lettre, kupo<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_101_003:1"
msgid "A consummate carrier like yourself letting <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> mailbox go unattended? This simply won't do, kupo! Do some cleaning, and with haste, lest there be no room for new deliveries!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、そろそろレターを整理しないと、<br>新しいレターが受け取れなくなるクポ。
#. de: Dein Briefkasten ist ja schon kupo voll, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Da solltest du was unternehmen, sonst platzt er bald aus allen Nähten.
#. fr: Au fait, je te signale que ta boîte est presque pleine, kupo<nbsp>! Si tu ne tries pas ton courrier, je ne pourrai bientôt plus prendre de lettres pour toi.
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_102_003:1"
msgid "Your mailbox is filling up fast! You should do something about it quick, or I won't be able to fit in any more letters!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、もうポストが一杯で、<br>受け取りを、お断りしちゃったレターがあるクポ。<br>いらないレターは消して、こまめに整理整頓クポ！
#. de: Aber dein Briefkasten ist ein riesiger ungeordneter Haufen. Da ging kein einziger Brief mehr rein, deswegen musste ich schon was zurückschicken, kupo.
#. fr: D'ailleurs, je te ferai remarquer que ta boîte est pleine<nbsp>! J'ai été obligé de refuser du courrier qui t'était adressé, kupopo<nbsp>! Fais un peu de place si tu veux que la livraison reprenne son cours<nbsp>!
