#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/000/CmnDefMogLetter_00002:TEXT_CMNDEFMOGLETTER_00002_LETTERMOOGLE_000_004:1"
msgid "Your mailbox is a complete and utter mess! There wasn't any room left, so I had to send back <if ($n1 == 1)>a letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if> letters</if>, kupo! Perhaps you've been spending too much time delivering others' letters and not enough attending to your own?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……それから、もうポストが一杯で、<br><num $n1>通のレターをお断りしちゃったクポ。<br>配達士なら、自分のレターの把握もしっかりクポ。
#. de: Aber dein Briefkasten ist ein riesiger ungeordneter Haufen. Da ging kein einziger Brief mehr rein, deswegen musste ich schon <if ($n1 == 1)>einen<else><num $n1></if> zurückschicken, kupo. Von <if $gn4>einer Veteranin<else>einem Veteranen</if> hätte ich mehr erwartet, auch wenn du kein echter Mogry bist ...
#. fr: D'ailleurs, je te ferai remarquer que ta boîte est pleine<nbsp>! J'ai été obligé de refuser <kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> lettre<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if> qui t'étai<if ($n1 == 1)>t<else>ent</if> adressée<if ($n1 == 1)><else>s</if>, kupopo<nbsp>! Fais un peu de place, jette toutes celles dont tu n'as plus besoin<nbsp>! C'est le B.A-BA en tant qu'assistant postier, kupo<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>a letter<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
